Academic note: please cite the IEEE Access manuscript (title and DOI as
printed) when using this package. The code is not certified for field
deployment, MW facilities, or detailed UPS inner-loop control.
SIL is not a hardware-in-the-loop campaign. UART HIL of the heuristic on
four short scenarios is closed; a 1200-step serial MPC HIL campaign and
FIL (HDL Verifier) were not completed. ADMM on Cyclone IV Lite is
demonstrated, not a 1 s real-time product.
